de>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Resistance\"> Condition: Resistance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Resistance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Resistance (Condition)\">Resistance</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Gains a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>+1d4</b> bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a></li><li> Class level 2: <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Land\" title=\"Circle of the Land\">Circle of the Land</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Magic_Initiate_Cleric_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Cleric\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Cleric\">Magic Initiate: Cleric</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Magic_Initiate_Druid_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Initiate:_Druid\" title=\"Magic Initiate: Druid\">Magic Initiate: Druid</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>The incantation for Resistance is <b>Resisto</b>, Latin for <i>\"I resist\"</i>.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Resistance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Resistance\">Resistance</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.084 seconds\nReal